<h2 itemprop="name" class="entry-title edgtf-post-title" >
            <a itemprop="url" href="https://galatabusinessangels.com/tr/kurumsal-hayat-mi-girisimcilik-mi/" title="Kurumsal Hayat mı, Girişimcilik mi?">
            Kurumsal Hayat mı, Girişimcilik mi?            </a>
    </h2>                    <div class="edgtf-post-info-top">
                        <div class="edgtf-post-info-author">
    <span class="edgtf-post-info-author-text">
        By    </span>
    <a itemprop="author" class="edgtf-post-info-author-link" href="https://galatabusinessangels.com/tr/author/gba-admin/">
